MODULE: CompletionOutsideDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an external completion reports an unsupported operation state
PERTURBS: Complete

--- FIND
Complete(g) ==
    /\ operation[g] = "running"
    /\ operation' = [operation EXCEPT ![g] = "done"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<turn, queued, served, timer, age>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: an external completion reports an unsupported operation state
Complete(g) ==
    /\ operation[g] = "running"
    /\ operation' = [operation EXCEPT ![g] = "unknown"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<turn, queued, served, timer, age>>
--- END
